          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa mahanga, ni mwīgire hafi kugira ngo mwumve; mutege amatwi mwa moko mwe; isi ni yumve, bo n’ibiyuzuye; n’ivu n’ibirimeramwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ Uhoraho ashangashiriwe amahanga yose, akaba arakiye ingabo zayo zose, arabagesheje rwose, arabagabuye ngo bicwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 2:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishwe babo bazoshiburirwa hirya, umunuko w’imivyimba yabo uzoduhuka, imisozi izojegeshwa n’ ibitenga vy’amaraso yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.2.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 2:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 6:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingabo z’inyenyeri zo kw ijuru zose zizokamangana, kand’ amajuru azozingirwa hamwe nk’umuzingo w’igitabo, n’izo ngabo zayo zose zizokabirana, nk’ukw akaragarira kava ku muzabibu, kandi nk’ ukw akaragarira kava ku musukoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.63.1+ISA.63.2+ISA.63.3+ISA.63.4+ISA.63.5+ISA.63.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 63:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.7+JER.49.8+JER.49.9+JER.49.10+JER.49.11+JER.49.12+JER.49.13+JER.49.14+JER.49.15+JER.49.16+JER.49.17+JER.49.18+JER.49.19+JER.49.20+JER.49.21+JER.49.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 49:7-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.1.2+MAL.1.3+MAL.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 1:2-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukw inkota yanje inyoye mw ijuru igahāga; non’ igira igwe ku Banyedomu, no ku bantu navumye, ngw ibahane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zef 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkota y’Uhoraho yuzuyekw amaraso, ihāze ibinure, amaraso y’imyagazi y’intama n’impene, n’ibinure vyo ku mafyigo y’amasuguru y’intama; kuk’ Uhoraho yifitiye ikimazi i Bosira, n’ukugeseza gukomeye mu gihugu ca Edomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imbogo zizogwa hamwe na vyo, amashūri hamwe n’amapfizi; igihugu cabo kizoborerwa amaraso, n’ivu ry’i wabo rizohāga ibinure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.61.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 61:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ uwo musi ari wo wo guhōra kw’ Uhoraho, n’umwaka wo kubasubiriza mu nkōko ku vyo bāgiriye Siyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imigezi yaho izohinduka kaburimbi, n’ivu ryaho rizohinduka amazuku; kand’ igihugu caho kizohinduka kaburimbi yaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.66.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 66:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.14.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 14:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntikizozimwa ku murango no mw ijoro, umwotsi waco uzopfunduka ibihe bidashira; kizohora ar’ amatongo uk’ urunganwe rwabo ruzogenda rukurikirana: kandi nta wuzogicamwo gushitsa ibihe bitazoshira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arikw inkongori n’ibinyogoto ni vyo bizocegukira, ibihuna n’ibikona na vyo bizokibamwo; azohageresha umugozi, ni wo bitongozi, na karisho,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "karisho",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": rāba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.28.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 28:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ko gusigara ubusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazohamagara abashingantahe b’ico gihugu ngo bimike umwami, ariko nta bazoba bariho; kand’ abaganwa baho bose bazoba bacitse ubusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.13.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 13:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.13.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.32.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "32:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingoro zaho zizomeramw’ amahwa, n’ibihome vyaho bizomeramw’ ibisuru n’ibitovu; hazoba ubgishinzo bg’ imbgebge n’inama y’ibisīga vyitwa imbuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibikōko vyo mu bugaragwa bizohūrirayo n’amabingira, n’igisigo c’impfizi y’impene kizohamagarana na mugenzi waco, mbere n’ikinyejoro kizohagerēra, kihibonere uburuhukiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ho imvuvyi izokwigirira umwimba, ihatere amagi, ihamenagurire, ikumakumire musi y’igitūtu cayo: mber’ aho ni ho ibinyakabaka bizokoranira, ikigore cose kiri kumwe n’ikigabo caco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni murondere mu gitabo c’Uhoraho musome: nta na kimwe co mur’ ivyo kizobura, nta kigore kizobura ikigabo caco, kukw akanwa kiwe ari ko kabigeze, kand’ impwemu ziwe akaba ari zo zibikoranije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.78.55"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 78:55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabipfindiye ubupfindo, kand’ ukuboko kwiwe ni kwo kwahabigaburiye n’umugozi; bizohegukira gushitsa ibihe vyose, bihabe ukw ibihe bihaye ibindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
